// Applications changing their own access
// Agentic attack detections by ThreatDefence (cross-framework behavior, first written for ARTEX). Source: https://threatdefence.com/article/artex-agentic-attack-framework-detection-hunting
// ATT&CK: T1098.001 (Account Manipulation: Additional Cloud Credentials), T1098.003 (Account Manipulation: Additional Cloud Roles)
// Example hunt for Microsoft Sentinel and Defender XDR advanced hunting. Test and baseline before alerting.
// Storm-0940's agents added credentials to applications and one application assigned itself Global Administrator.
// Check every row against a change record. Automation accounts will appear here, so build a list of the ones you expect.

// Example: credential additions and role or permission grants made by an application, not a person
AuditLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where OperationName in ("Add service principal credentials", "Add member to role", "Add app role assignment to service principal")
    or OperationName has "Certificates and secrets management"
| extend ActorApp = tostring(InitiatedBy.app.displayName), ActorSpId = tostring(InitiatedBy.app.servicePrincipalId)
| where isnotempty(ActorSpId)
| extend Target = tostring(TargetResources[0].displayName), TargetId = tostring(TargetResources[0].id)
| extend SelfChange = ActorSpId == TargetId
| project TimeGenerated, OperationName, ActorApp, ActorSpId, Target, TargetId, SelfChange, Result
| order by TimeGenerated asc
